WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Zero kara kakedashite

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Start running from
the beginning,

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
Omoi dake
wo dakishimete

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
with nothing but your emotions
in your hands.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Sonomama kakenukete

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Just keep running...

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
Itsumo koko
de mitsumeteru

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
I'm always watching
you from here.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
Hajimete deatta hi no
manazashi wasurenai

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
I still remember your expression
the day we first met.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
Taiyou mitai ni kokoro
wo terashitekureta

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
It lit up my heart like the sun.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
Asu no yukue sagashite
nayandeiru nara

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
If you're anxious about
where to go tomorrow,

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
Ima kimi no tame
ni akari ni naritai yo

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
I want to become
a beacon to you.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Zero kara tobidatte

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Start flying from
the beginning.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Let go of your current self...

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Ima no kimi
wo toki hanachi

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
and fly towards infinity.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
Mugen ni habataite

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
I will always watch over you...

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
Donna toki
mo mimaru yo

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
no matter how far you fly.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
Kitto zutto tooku made

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:47.890
Her presence is unbelievable.

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:51.740
She transformed the whole
area in an instant.

00:01:51.740 --> 00:01:55.240
She draws the hearts of the audience
into the play in a flash.

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:57.210
But then, should I expect
anything less from her?

00:01:58.080 --> 00:01:59.460
Chigusa.

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:01.690
Ma'am...

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:05.140
Ms. Tsukikage...

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:10.120
Episode 51 - The
Scarlet Angel

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:17.510
Long, long ago, stars that glowed strangely
appeared above the capital.

00:02:17.510 --> 00:02:22.240
The big temples at Nara and Mt. Hiei
all started to burn, one after another.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:28.440
Mt. Fuji erupted and the earth shook;
the waves turned into tsunamis,

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:31.700
and strange aberrations
kept occurring.

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:38.050
As the land was split with conflict,
the capital was destroyed;

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:45.100
and finally, in the dust, there stood two
capitals, two emperors- two countries.

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:51.270
Who?

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:54.020
Who is trying to wake me?

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.520
Who is it?

00:02:56.510 --> 00:03:01.350
The energy of human wars has sent the
energy of the natural world into disarray.

00:03:01.350 --> 00:03:07.000
If they continue along this path, the
humans will annihilate themselves.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:11.420
Leave them be.

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:16.450
It is ordained that humans are
to steer the human world.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.630
I must not interfere.

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:36.720
What is this? Warm and crazed, with a sadness
so saccharine, it's frightening.

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:40.430
I've never felt this way before.

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:46.810
Something will happen
to me soon.

00:03:48.730 --> 00:03:52.790
Elsewhere, there stood a village
in the Scarlet Valley,

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:54.170
tucked away from civilization
in the mountains.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:56.750
A girl named Akoya
lived there.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:04:02.840
She was a mysterious girl whose heart was so attuned
to the gods, she could hear their voices.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:03.880
And...

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:07.630
I'm on a journey to find a plum tree that took
root around here a thousand years ago,

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:11.860
so that I can carve a statue to
house the spirit of an angel.

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:14.660
I am the Buddhist woodcarver, Isshin.

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:20.600
No!

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:26.260
This sort of wood is nowhere
near worthy of the Buddha.

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:31.590
Won't anyone bestow the sacred
plum wood I require upon me?

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:36.670
Conflict would surely be banished from
this world if I had just that!

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:44.250
Just thinking about you
makes my chest ache.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:48.270
You are another me.

00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:51.600
And I am another you.

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:57.760
Dearest Akoya. When I collapsed in the valley
and was struck down with amnesia,

00:04:57.760 --> 00:05:00.270
you nursed me
back to health.

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:03.280
Since that day, you have
been the only one for me.

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:11.130
Though our souls lives in two bodies, let us
live together as one from this day forth.

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:16.580
One life, one soul
-a shared soul!

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:20.410
Now that we've met, how can
we possibly live apart?

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:23.760
I can't bear to be separated
from you!

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:33.800
All I need is my eyes to see you with, my arms
to hold you with, and this body to love you with.

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:37.150
I love you.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:39.920
Is that really Ms. Tsukikage?

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:41.320
She sounds so sweet.

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:43.010
So loving.

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:45.170
Chigusa.

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:50.220
Akoya, please beseech
the gods.

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:53.360
The great god of the
sacred valley.

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:56.770
The great Crimson God.

00:06:05.430 --> 00:06:10.450
Isshin... Akoya is not human.

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:12.740
They say that if you fall in love
with someone who isn't human,

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:15.790
one of you must eventually
die as a consequence.

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:17.500
So what? Who cares if I die?

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:20.380
I am not only in love
with Akoya's body.

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:25.260
What I really fell
for was her soul!

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:30.250
Love. This is Akoya
and Isshin's love.

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.770
The love of the Scarlet Angel.

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:37.930
Don't fear her!
She is no goddess!

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:41.160
She's a deceiving she-devil!

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:46.660
Do not murder.

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:49.270
Do not stain the earth
with blood.

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:56.760
Please protect me just a little
longer, Ichiren!

00:06:57.300 --> 00:07:04.760
All living things are raised by the
music of heaven and earth.

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:10.280
The eternal music that fosters all
life never ceases to play...

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.470
Ms. Tsukikage...

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:18.570
Akoya lost her divine powers when
she fell in love with a human,

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:22.100
and her ability to move heaven and earth
was taken from her as well.

00:07:23.740 --> 00:07:25.210
I can't hear anything!

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:29.590
The sky, the birds, the trees, the grass...
none of them will talk to me!

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:31.940
I can't hear their hearts!

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:34.150
I can't hear them!

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:35.980
You monster!

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:39.560
Get out, you abomination!

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:42.870
Akoya!

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:44.880
Isshin.

00:07:46.550 --> 00:07:48.090
Get out of here, Akoya!

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:50.150
Save yourself!

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:52.110
Isshin!

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:05.320
This world is built
on opposites.

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:07.610
In other words...

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:12.090
Birth and death.

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:14.220
Creation and destruction.

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:15.970
Heaven and earth.

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:17.970
Fire and water.

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:19.900
Light and darkness.

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:24.260
And, man and woman.

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:30.990
Man and woman are born from the same
life. They are the yin and yang.

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:35.960
And from that yin and yang,
new life springs forth.

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:37.670
A goddess!

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:42.130
Akoya has come here
as a goddess!

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:47.050
Even when she's physically frail,
the goddess still shines through!

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:59.000
What's important is not how you die,
but how you've lived your life.

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:04.270
Killing each other through bloodshed
is an act that defies the gods!

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:06.570
But...

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:12.740
Can you not hear the
voice of the heavens?

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:15.100
Can you not hear the
voice of the earth?

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:18.280
There are gods in heaven
and on earth.

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:21.930
Through their union,
man was born.

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:23.980
Awaken!

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:26.850
Show me thy true form!

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:30.800
Recognize that life has
been given to you.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:33.610
Turn your ear to the
sound of heaven.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:35.880
Listen to what the earth
has to tell you!

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:42.420
The wind is my heart.

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:45.360
The fire is my strength.

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:48.940
The water is my life.

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:52.610
The earth is my love.

00:09:53.390 --> 00:09:57.980
Understand that
you are loved.

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:01.940
I must carve the Buddha into the
thousand-year-old plum tree.

00:10:01.940 --> 00:10:04.650
I must carve the statue
of an angel.

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:05.640
But you...

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:10.360
Akoya, you are the thousand-year-old plum tree.

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:13.620
You are the incarnation
of that plum tree.

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:28.610
Ms. Tsukikage...

00:10:28.610 --> 00:10:29.500
Ma'am...

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:34.350
Ichiren, just a little longer...
just a little more time...

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:43.230
I shall make the flowers of life bloom
for a thousand scarlet years!

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:51.560
You creatures that fly, run, swim,
and gallop across fields!

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:55.970
We are one and the same.

00:10:56.690 --> 00:11:01.010
You mountains, you
skies, you seas,

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:04.820
We are one and the same.

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:12.510
The soul turns into life to appear, just as life
turns back into a soul so it can hide again.

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:15.150
Who am I?

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:24.350
I am the trees, the birds, the winds,
the sky: I am the earth!

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:28.190
I am the life-force that bubbles
up from the depths of the earth.

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:31.680
The great heart that rains
down from the sky.

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:35.550
The power that binds together
the heavens and the earth:

00:11:35.550 --> 00:11:38.280
The Scarlet Angel!

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:46.180
What happened to the Buddhist
woodcarver Isshin,

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:50.470
who had made it his mission to carve an
angel out of the thousand-year-old tree?

00:11:50.470 --> 00:11:54.520
And what happened to Akoya, the incarnation
of the scarlet goddess who lived in that tree?

00:11:55.000 --> 00:12:00.670
What happened to those two, what happened
then, in the Valley of Plums?

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:02.940
Those things will not be told now.

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:07.510
The legend is passed on from generation to generation.

00:12:07.510 --> 00:12:14.580
And at some point, a new Scarlet Angel
will tell you the rest of the legend.

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:33.190
I have to think about....

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:35.990
...a new Scarlet Angel.

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:38.510
A new Scarlet Angel?

00:12:38.510 --> 00:12:40.500
How would I play such a role?

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:45.730
But Ms. Tsukikage has entrusted
the role to us.

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:48.230
Ms. Tsukikage has...

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:59.040
I shall never see Chigusa Tsukikage's
Scarlet Angel again.

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:03.020
Not in this lifetime.

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:14.240
How do you act out the confrontation
between her and her beloved Isshin?

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:21.810
Acting out the spirit of the
thousand-year-old plum tree.

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:46.000
Maya. Ayumi. The spell of the old
Scarlet Angel has been broken.

00:13:46.670 --> 00:13:53.580
If we continue to cling to the old one, the
Scarlet Angel will become a dying art.

00:13:55.240 --> 00:13:58.230
Maya. Ayumi.

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:05.490
Now, the two of you will create the
mask of a new Scarlet Angel.

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:09.320
The Scarlet Angels that
you will be working on,

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:14.110
the Scarlet Angels that
you have completed...

00:14:14.110 --> 00:14:17.570
I may not be able
to witness them.

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:25.340
But you two no longer need my
strength, nor my leadership.

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:30.170
You will create your own Scarlet
Angel with your own two hands.

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:45.540
I'm counting on you, Genzo.

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:50.250
To fulfill my final wish.

00:14:56.760 --> 00:15:00.590
Ms. Tsukikage?

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:21.680
The Scarlet Angel.

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:24.090
The spirit of the thousand-year-old
plum tree.

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:27.920
A fairy goddess who commands
all of nature.

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:30.960
The Scarlet Angel.

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:36.040
Another one of my masks...

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:47.590
This is the Valley
of the Plums.

00:15:50.650 --> 00:15:54.010
The home of <i>The
Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:06.770
What was that just now?!

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:10.080
What's going on?

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:14.790
Why? Why is it sparkling
all around?

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:22.600
Mr. Hayami...

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:25.790
Who's there?!

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:28.560
Mr. Hayami...

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:31.200
Mr. Purple Roses!

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:40.970
Mr. Hayami, I love you
more than anyone.

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:48.480
From the first day I
saw you, I knew it...

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:52.600
You are the other
half of my soul.

00:16:52.600 --> 00:16:55.010
When we are drawn
to each other,

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:58.430
regardless of age,
looks or class,

00:16:58.430 --> 00:17:04.660
and when we can't help but
desire our other halves...

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.460
Maya...

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.990
When you yearn for
the other's soul...

00:17:08.990 --> 00:17:12.610
so much that you become addled by lust
because of your desire to join as one...

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:14.680
That is love.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:22.010
We've met and we're alive.
Isn't that enough?

00:17:22.010 --> 00:17:29.260
Throw away your name and
your past and become mine.

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:32.380
Won't you do that for me?

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:36.080
Maya, what are you
trying to do?

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:40.230
You can't possibly
want me to...

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:46.370
Tell me that you're
Mr. Purple Roses.

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:48.830
If you do, then I'll...

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:26.790
You...

00:18:28.430 --> 00:18:31.760
You complete me...

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:36.030
You complete me...

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:42.130
Mr. Masumi!

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:50.070
Sir! Mr. Masumi!

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:52.600
Mr. Masumi!

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:55.160
Are you all right, sir?

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:57.050
Are you all right?

00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:01.320
Mr. Masumi?

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:09.630
Two halves of the
same soul...

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:11.420
Was that...

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:14.170
No, that wasn't a dream.

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:16.220
It wasn't an illusion.

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:20.120
Our hearts were connected, and for
a single moment, we became one.

00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:23.320
We were filled with
happiness.

00:19:23.320 --> 00:19:27.420
That couldn't have been real.

00:19:27.420 --> 00:19:34.340
That must be it. It was nothing more
than a beautiful, delightful  illusion.

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:43.420
I have a thousand masks and now,
I have the mask of the Scarlet Angel!

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:46.060
Ma'am!

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:55.440
Maya!

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:00.480
Ayumi!

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:01.730
Did you find her?

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:03.700
I looked everywhere
but no luck.

00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:05.770
Maya. Ayumi.

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:07.750
Mr. Genzo?

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:10.320
I've been waiting for
the two of you.

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:16.000
This is a message
from my mistress.

00:20:18.630 --> 00:20:20.120
Mr. Genzo!

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:21.340
Why?

00:20:21.340 --> 00:20:25.260
The valley where the spirit of the
thousand-year-old plum tree lives...

00:20:25.260 --> 00:20:28.240
no longer exists in this world.

00:20:39.860 --> 00:20:45.150
The sacred valley only exists
in your hearts now.

00:20:45.150 --> 00:20:49.340
That's where the Scarlet
Angel lives on.

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:52.100
That's where you'll find
your Scarlet Angel.

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:57.820
The Scarlet Angel is
already inside you.

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.740
Maya Kitajima.

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:02.340
Ayumi Himekawa.

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:10.320
Go out... go out into the world
of the Scarlet Angel.

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:25.580
The world will decide which one of you
shall have the Scarlet Angel in the end.

00:21:28.280 --> 00:21:34.350
Go out and face tough,
new challenges.

00:21:37.740 --> 00:21:47.680
Ayumi Himekawa and Maya Kitajima, you are destined
to be eternal rivals who shall never meet again...

00:21:47.680 --> 00:21:49.840
Neither in the past...
nor in the future.

00:21:51.050 --> 00:21:56.080
Hello hello

00:21:51.050 --> 00:21:56.080
Hello, hello.

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:14.680
Fukanou dato iwarenagara
tobitatte

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:14.680
Even though they say it's
impossible, I fly off.

00:22:14.680 --> 00:22:24.560
Kanaeta yume mo koboreochita
yume mo aru

00:22:14.680 --> 00:22:24.560
There are dreams that come true,
and dreams that crumble away.

00:22:24.560 --> 00:22:36.230
Soredemo isshoukenmei ikiru
kazu dake hoshi ga fueru

00:22:24.560 --> 00:22:36.230
But even then, for every person trying hard
to live their life, a new star is born.

00:22:36.230 --> 00:22:48.640
Kyou mo mata hitotsu
umareru hoshi miagete

00:22:36.230 --> 00:22:48.640
Today, I look up again, at
another newly born star.

00:22:48.640 --> 00:22:49.970
And I say,

